DFE5 E05A             (    forth6809.asm):01872                  FDB   QUIT
                      (    forth6809.asm):01873         
                      (    forth6809.asm):01874         ; FIND had no dictionary entry at all - confirmed by checking for
                      (    forth6809.asm):01875         ; any H_FIND label or FCC "FIND" string anywhere in this file
                      (    forth6809.asm):01876         ; before adding this. Its actual implementation (verified before
                      (    forth6809.asm):01877         ; exposing it) already matches the standard stack effect exactly:
                      (    forth6809.asm):01878         ; success pushes xt then 1 (immediate) or -1 (normal); failure
                      (    forth6809.asm):01879         ; reconstructs and pushes the original c-addr, then 0.
