E97C 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03533                  PSHU  D          ; 10,S, which was itself wrong - it assumed
E97E 39               (    forth6809.asm):03534                  RTS              ; DOSETUP's own JSR-pushed return address
                      (    forth6809.asm):03535                                   ; persists on S once each DOSETUP finishes.
